we're SO BACK!\n\nMETA Muse Glimmer 30B now runs:\n\n233.8% faster on a DGX Spark\n191.2% faster https://t.co/zaxzsH8Rtj https://t.co/mGl2DOumaj","url":"https://x.com/GumbiiDigital/status/2126306854833668280"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:24:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126306045442101646"],"id":"2126306045442101646","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@TheoEmeka2 It's the Meta Muse Charm, a small AI gadget with a screen and lanyard for talking to Muse (not a phone; it can't make/answer calls itself). \n\nReports put the expected price at about $300, with up to 12 months free Verizon 5G. Official pricing not confirmed yet; ships around","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2126306045442101646"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126301579276115969","3_2126301607491162112"]},"author_id":"2019021305002258432","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:23:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126305945122979866"],"id":"2126305945122979866","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":202,"like_count":5,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今天好好试了一下字节的小豆（对标 Meta Muse 的个人 Agent），现在 Bot 是真的多，根本用不完，测完觉得完全没必要去闲鱼买码，甚至连蹲邀请码都没啥必要\n\n小豆给了一台 2C4G 的 Linux 沙箱，带 X11 和 Chrome（图 2），但没开放可视化桌面给用户接管，AI https://t.co/cZiK1TQH4K","url":"https://x.com/Aurora0x3f/status/2126305945122979866"},{"author_id":"833172884142985216","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:23:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126305837471949304"],"id":"2126305837471949304","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":35,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/XxrUHYZthg\nスゴデキエンジニアのプラクティスをまねるか、Meta MuseとGrok Botみたいに出たものにどんどん乗り換えるかの二択感ある。こういう、あーわかる！ってのが良くて僕は前者かなぁ","url":"https://x.com/ma_anago/status/2126305837471949304"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126305545460035585"]},"author_id":"1828200096707592192","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:22:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126305647251575215"],"id":"2126305647251575215","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Puse un registro en Rootbase de cada agente de IA que lee la web.\n\nChatGPT: 58\nAlexa: 49\nPerplexity: 44\nMeta Muse: 28\nGemini: 6\nClaude: 4\n\nChatGPT lee casi 15 veces más que Claude, y para eso manda 3 bots distintos.\n\nEl log en vivo: https://t.co/qWfLVPKo8N https://t.co/FpNH5zM3dQ","url":"https://x.com/kveen_io/status/2126305647251575215"},{"article":{"title":"小豆 vs Muse 详细对比"},"author_id":"2092943600825020416","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:21:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126305445992415402"],"id":"2126305445992415402","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":32,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"小豆 vs Muse 详细对比来了。一个吃国内超App生态（抖音+飞书），一个吃云端虚拟机+跨服务执行。功能、计费、上线时间都写清楚了，看完你就知道该选哪个。 https://t.co/p9lQCdAKVl","url":"https://x.com/Rubyzhanggkhv/status/2126305445992415402"},{"author_id":"1475232253458350082","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:15:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126303886931849242"],"id":"2126303886931849242","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":12,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Day 26. My Meta @Muse invite code is 4KV04O, add it in Settings. Day 28 tomorrow: alumni and community outreach.","url":"https://x.com/anthonycoaches/status/2126303886931849242"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126302974658183168"]},"author_id":"1475232253458350082","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:15:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126303883089924177"],"id":"2126303883089924177","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Day 26: facility and field requests. A field request sent late is a practice moved or lost. My assistant, Meta Muse, keeps every request, permit, and rain plan in one place so the calendar holds.\n\n#SoftballCoach #MetaMuse https://t.co/cRtNwbtYBa","url":"https://x.com/anthonycoaches/status/2126303883089924177"},{"author_id":"2126055935181193216","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:12:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126303151401951496"],"id":"2126303151401951496","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Starting an English account for China's AI hardware &amp; agents most people outside never touch.\n\nOn my desk: ByteDance's nubia M153 AI phone, their new Xiaodou agent, and Meta Muse.\n\nEarly takeaway: AI phones aren't losing to latency, they're losing to app walls.","url":"https://x.com/theyiran_en/status/2126303151401951496"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126302951614693376","3_2126302978407882752"]},"author_id":"1734561372644749312","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:12:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126303042828128620"],"id":"2126303042828128620","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":28,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"페유샵(PWSTORE) 통합 최저가\n✅ 메타 뮤즈(Meta Muse) 완성 계정·토큰 충전 4,300원~23,800원\n✅ 익스프레스VPN 4,500원 · 디즈니+ 프리미엄 1개월 3,500원~\n✅ 원신·명조·붕스·쿠킹덤 외 게임 견적\n가격표 사진 참고, DM 문의 환영\n#메타뮤즈 #뮤즈 #디즈니플러스 #익스프레스VPN #페유샵 https://t.co/sXaGm1kAN3","url":"https://x.com/genshintrade920/status/2126303042828128620"},{"author_id":"1827277799620751360","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:11:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126302851509232039"],"id":"2126302851509232039","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":31,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"【iPhoneでMeta Museを始めるには📱】\n\n必要な方はご活用ください。残り 5 以下です。\n🎁Muse招待コード：YMRYOU 🎉✨\n🎁Muse Invite Code: YMRYOU 🎉✨\n参加後48時間以内に入力し、条件を満たすと10億トークンが付与されます。\n\nApp Storeの公式アプリ情報と、登録・初期設定の流れをまとめました。","url":"https://x.com/2abundant2free/status/2126302851509232039"},{"author_id":"1